#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Jaeger_Base
#: liminal-union/units/halfelven/maiden/a1-jaeger.cfg:64
msgid "A Maiden Corps Jaeger is part of the ranged infantry reserve of the Maiden Corps, trained to make skilled use of her wingsuit. Many of them are young mothers: raising and teaching the next generation, they naturally keep to archery practice at home rather than in a camp. In times of need they are called to service; otherwise they defend their own communities. They are equipped with the finest Arcanite-composite light armour the corps can provide, for no unit is held more beloved or revered. They operate in squads, harassing enemy infantry with a sustained hail of arrows from their short bows. They avoid individual close combat, preferring always to fight in concert. They have learned hard lessons against drake raids on their homeland, and their Arcanite-cold sling-rounds carry a chill that unsettles even draconic flesh."
msgstr "Une Chasseresse (Jaeger) du Corps des Maïden fait partie de la réserve d'infanterie à distance, entraînée au maniement habile de sa combinaison ailée. Beaucoup sont de jeunes mères : élevant et instruisant la génération suivante, elles s'exercent naturellement à l'arc chez elles plutôt qu'au camp. Équipées des meilleures armures légères composites d'Arcanite, elles opèrent en escouades et harcèlent l'infanterie ennemie d'une grêle de flèches. Leurs projectiles d'arcanite glaciale portent un froid qui trouble jusqu'à la chair des drakes."

