#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Sergeant_Base
#: liminal-union/units/halfelven/marines/a1-sergeant.cfg:63
msgid "A Marine Sergeant is part of the infantry reserve of the Marine Corps. Many of them are young fathers, raising and teaching the next generation; they naturally keep to combat training at home rather than in a standing camp. In times of need they may be drafted, or step forward on their own to defend their communities. The Sergeant is a swift all-round defender, armed with Arcanite-composite light armour, a hardened alu-bronze sword, and a precision sling. He is trained in both land and naval combat. Against forces unshielded by sorcerous protection — such as human or dunefolk levies — he holds a clear advantage. His Arcanite-fire sling-rounds, however, find less purchase against the scaled hides of draken."
msgstr "Un Sergent Marine fait partie de la réserve d'infanterie du Corps des Marines. Beaucoup sont de jeunes pères qui élèvent et instruisent la génération suivante, s'entraînant au combat chez eux plutôt que dans un camp permanent. Le Sergent est un défenseur polyvalent et véloce, équipé d'une armure légère composite d'Arcanite, d'une épée en alu-bronze trempé et d'une fronde de précision, rompu au combat terrestre comme naval."

