#: liminal-union/units/halfelven/marines/b2-weaponguard.cfg:57
msgid "The Weaponguard wields twin mithril blades. Speed and disciplined skill working in concert, he moves through enemy lines with a reaper's surety — reading every opening, turning movement, momentum, and cover to his advantage. Few who face a Weaponguard in full press survive to take his measure a second time."
msgstr "Le Garde-arme manie deux lames de mithril. Alliant vitesse et maîtrise disciplinée, il fend les lignes ennemies avec l'assurance d'un faucheur — lisant chaque ouverture et tournant le mouvement, l'élan et le couvert à son avantage."

